            >
              <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-white"></span>
              Founder · Developer · Creator
            </div>

            <h1
              class="max-w-5xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.045em] sm:text-6xl lg:text-8xl"
            >
              I'm Yashotkarsh.
              <span class="mt-2 block text-white/35">
                I build things for the web.
              </span>
            </h1>

            <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-white/60 sm:text-xl">
              I'm the founder of YNS Web Studio, a Jaipur-based web development
              studio focused on building fast, modern, SEO-ready and
              conversion-focused digital experiences for businesses.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
