          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/30">
            01 · The beginning
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
            I didn't start with a business plan.
            <span class="text-white/35">
              I started with curiosity.
            </span>
          </h2>

          <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-white/55">

            <p>
              My journey into technology started with a simple curiosity about
              how websites and software actually work.
            </p>

            <p>
              I wanted to understand how an idea could turn into something
              people could interact with through a screen.
            </p>

            <p>
              I started with the fundamentals — HTML, CSS, JavaScript and
              programming logic — and gradually moved into databases,
              backend development, APIs and modern frontend frameworks.
            </p>

            <p>
              The more I learned, the more I realized that programming wasn't
              just about writing code.
            </p>

            <p class="text-white/75">
              It was about solving problems.
            </p>

          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- JOURNEY -->
    <section class="border-y border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02]">
