            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white/40">
                04
              </p>

              <p class="mt-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-white/25">
                Production
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold">
                Building for real users
              </h3>

              <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-8 text-white/45">
                Professional development work taught me the difference between
                a project that works on a developer's machine and a product
                that needs to work reliably for real users.
              </p>

              <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-8 text-white/45">
                Deadlines, responsive interfaces, APIs, databases,
                production deployments, debugging, performance and SEO all
                became part of my practical development experience.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>


          <article class="grid gap-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-[#080808] p-7 sm:p-9 lg:grid-cols-[180px_1fr]">
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white/40">
                05
              </p>

              <p class="mt-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-white/25">
                Creator
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold">
                Learning the other side of the internet
              </h3>

              <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-8 text-white/45">
                Alongside development, I explored content creation and started
                creating VN video-editing templates under
                <strong class="font-medium text-white/70">@_apoorvasonu</strong>.
              </p>

              <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-8 text-white/45">
                That experience introduced me to audience behaviour, visual
                storytelling, short-form content, trends, attention,
                distribution and digital reach.
