            Before building digital businesses,
            <span class="text-white/30">
              I learned how digital attention works.
            </span>
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-white/50">

          <p>
            Through <strong class="font-medium text-white/75">@_apoorvasonu</strong>,
            I explored the world of short-form video and VN editing templates.
          </p>

          <p>
            I created and shared templates around gym edits, travel content,
